{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>FormuLens 是一款成分標籤掃描工具，適合關注護膚、彩妝、頭髮護理、身體護理與香水成分的用戶。只需拍照或匯入標籤，即可把 INCI 成分清單轉為清楚易懂的英文說明，並協助比較產品與檢查日常護理程序。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-11.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>拍照讀懂成分標籤</h2>\n<p>拍攝或匯入英文、法文、韓文、日文及中文成分標籤後，FormuLens 會整理 INCI 名稱，並解釋保濕劑、柔潤劑、防腐劑、防曬等成分角色。它可將最多 6 件同類產品並列比較，亦可檢查最多 8 個護理步驟的配搭、成分重疊與致敏原累積，所有分析均在裝置上完成。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-17-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-18-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-19-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-20-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-21-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-22-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：FormuLens: Ingredient Scanner</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/formulens-ingredient-scanner/id6783632029?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:50.457183+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T05:14:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:58:34.196272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:12.799170+00:00","content_hash":"bf5128b2cfa996d305fdbf1321a1b1a7d73ea3a89b6fe7b020991cdf420e6b55","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}